# Decisions ledger — REQ-V3-GREENFIELD-R1

The durable, machine-consumable record of every V ruling. Tickets are sitting
containers; THIS file is the authority trail. The map and spec cite DR IDs.

Schema per record:

```
DR-NNN | date | type: V-RULING | source ticket | decision (exact normative text)
      | conditions | affected rows/params | supersedes | status: FINAL|CONDITIONAL
```

Label vocabulary elsewhere in the packet: FACT (research finding),
V-RULING (decision, lives here), SEAT-PROPOSAL (agent recommendation, never
authority), OPEN (awaiting a sitting).

## Charting rulings (owner: 00-intake-H0.md §Charting rulings — summarized here as index rows)

- **DR-001** | 2026-08-03 | V-RULING | intake | Destination = buildable spec pack (4 artifacts: requirements spec, carryover manifest, UI boundary contract, race criteria) | — | mission scope | — | FINAL
- **DR-002** | 2026-08-03 | V-RULING | intake | V2 UI kept, MAY FLEX only where the old contract genuinely can't express battery outputs | per-output negotiation in ticket 16 | UI contract | — | FINAL
- **DR-003** | 2026-08-03 | V-RULING | intake | Carryover is CLEAN-ROOM: no V2 code copied; kept organs re-specified from behavior | [condition superseded by DR-033: equivalence-testing dead; organs kept as DESIGNS] | carryover manifest | — | FINAL
- **DR-004** | 2026-08-03 | V-RULING | intake | ALL 62 questions + ALL 9 rules receive concrete dispositions; experiments deferred until after a working prototype and never gate the spec | — | coverage law, all rows | — | FINAL
- **DR-005** | 2026-08-03 | V-RULING | intake | Requirements constrain BEHAVIOR only; stack proposed by ARCHITECTURE, ratified by V there | — | spec scope | — | FINAL
- **DR-006** | 2026-08-03 | V-RULING | intake | Review gates: three lenses (Codex executability, Grok red-team, Hermes stranger); THE ORCHESTRATOR merges and adjudicates — at every multi-agent convergence point the orchestrator merges, never a worker | mission-scoped spine deviation | process | — | FINAL
